{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18103630","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18103630","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1810363001:1":{"text":"이 늙은이, <style=\"highlight\">테페시아 님</style>을 뵙습니다...","source_cn":"老身……拜见<style=highlight>苔佩希阁...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86126333E0DA24D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1810363002:0":{"text":"수선의 집 뮤리엘 할멈이 오션 오페라 극장까지는 무슨 일로?","source_cn":"修缮屋的穆婆婆。你可不是海歌剧场的常客。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x45E306C07010CCCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1810363003:1":{"text":"세니아 때문에 온 거야? 하지만 너무 늦었는걸.","source_cn":"特地为塞涅而来吗？迟到得太久了吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C891A9E8E47DD63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1810363004:1":{"text":"영주님을... 뵈러 왔습니다.","source_cn":"老身来此……是为了寻您。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14080A6F64C24501","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1810363005:1":{"text":"이유는?","source_cn":"原因？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38AA45EEA52A97E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1810363006:1":{"text":"수선의 집에 붉은 촛불꽃에 감염된 녀석이 있어서...","source_cn":"修缮屋里，有人被赤烛蕊感染……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2045B73734FFA3CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1810363007:1":{"text":"그 금발 머리 직원?","source_cn":"你那位留着金色长发的员工？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF4D8B48C9D2B779","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1810363008:1":{"text":"아, 아닙니다. 환자입니다. 산 자지요.","source_cn":"不……不是。是一位病人，是生者。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2ED02133377F70D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1810363009:1":{"text":"어머, 손등에 핏줄까지 바짝 세우고 긴장했으면서. 감히 내 눈을 속일 수 있다고 생각했니?","source_cn":"瞧瞧你手背上的青筋，既然如此紧张，为何还敢在余面前撒谎？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6162E8F3E89CCE65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1810363010:1":{"text":"부두로 숨어들어오는 레오프론 놈들만도 못한 그 조잡한 마법으로, 내 눈을 속일 수 있을 거라 생각했어?","source_cn":"那年轻的生者不过是被你用拙劣的魔法做了一番遮掩，伪装程...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13894545615E1AEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1810363011:1":{"text":"그, 그것은...","source_cn":"老身……老身是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD684B980BA71074","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1810363012:1":{"text":"잔뜩 겁먹은 꼴 좀 보라지. 널 잡아먹으면 씹는 맛은 꽤 있겠지만, 피가 바짝 말라서 신선도는 형편없겠구나.","source_cn":"瞧你怕成了什么样？你身上的肉嚼劲虽足，但鲜度太差劲了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FFFE301A3D78B4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1810363013:1":{"text":"구하고 싶어?","source_cn":"你想救他？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFF9E953D23E4163","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1810363014:1":{"text":"...예. 이 늙은이는... 녀석을 반드시 구해야 합니다.","source_cn":"……是。老身……必须救他。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD02D4904D3EB1692","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1810363015:0":{"text":"흐음... 이유를 캐묻기는 귀찮지만, 내 티타임을 방해했으니 대가는 치러야겠지?","source_cn":"嗯……理由余懒得追究，但你打搅了余的下午茶，总该付出些代价。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F7B4AD882EBF3BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1810363016:1":{"text":"네 옆에 있는 그레이브본은 처음 보는데, 새로운 직원?","source_cn":"你身边那个亡灵好面生啊。新员工？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0974E17B38EB38CB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_ke